%% Studio RAG L3 — embed lock vs LLM swap (best practice)
flowchart TB
  subgraph lock["Lock together"]
    EM[Embedding model]
    IDX[Chunk vectors in DB]
    EM --- IDX
  end

  subgraph free["Swap freely"]
    LLM1[LLM A e.g. Gemini]
    LLM2[LLM B e.g. OpenRouter]
    LLM3[LLM C e.g. Groq]
  end

  Q[Query] --> EM
  EM --> RET[Retrieve chunks]
  RET --> LLM1
  RET --> LLM2
  RET --> LLM3

  BAD[Ganti embedding tanpa reindex] -.->|FORBIDDEN| IDX
  NOTE[Jawaban jelek setelah ganti LLM:<br/>cek prompt / kepatuhan dulu<br/>bukan wajib samakan vendor embed]
